<h3 id="switch-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#switch-props"><span>Switch Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>model-value(<strong>v-model</strong>)</td>
<td>绑定值</td>
<td><code v-pre>string|number|boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>default-checked</td>
<td>默认选中状态(非受控状态)</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>disabled</td>
<td>是否禁用</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>loading</td>
<td>是否为加载中状态</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>type</td>
<td>开关的类型</td>
<td><code v-pre>'circle'|'round'|'line'</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>'circle'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size</td>
<td>开关的大小</td>
<td><code v-pre>'sm'|'md'|'lg'</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>'md'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>checked-value</td>
<td>选中时的值</td>
<td><code v-pre>string|number|boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>true</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>unchecked-value</td>
<td>为选中时的值</td>
<td><code v-pre>string|number|boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>checked-color</td>
<td>选中时的开关颜色</td>
<td><code v-pre>string</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>unchecked-color</td>
<td>未选中时的开关颜色</td>
<td><code v-pre>string</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>before-change</td>
<td>switch状态改变前的钩子，返回false或者返回Promise且被reject则停止切换。</td>
<td><code v-pre>( newValue: string | number | boolean) =&gt; Promise&lt;boolean | void&gt; | boolean | void</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>checked-text</td>
<td>打开状态时的文案(<code v-pre>type='line'</code>和<code v-pre>size='sm'</code>时不生效)</td>
<td><code v-pre>string</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>unchecked-text</td>
<td>关闭状态时的文案(<code v-pre>type='line'</code>和<code v-pre>size='sm'</code>时不生效)</td>
<td><code v-pre>string</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="switch-events" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#switch-events"><span>Switch Events</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>事件名</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>参数</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>change</td>
<td>值改变时触发</td>
<td><code v-pre>value:boolean|string|number|ev:Event</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>focus</td>
<td>组件获得焦点时触发</td>
<td><code v-pre>ev:FocusEvent</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>blur</td>
<td>组件失去焦点时触发</td>
<td><code v-pre>ev:FocusEvent</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="switch-slots" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#switch-slots"><span>Switch Slots</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>插槽名</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>checked-icon</td>
<td>打开状态时，按钮上的图标</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>unchecked-icon</td>
<td>关闭状态时，按钮上的图标</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>checked</td>
<td>打开状态时的文案(<code v-pre>type='line'</code>和<code v-pre>size='sm'</code>时不生效)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>unchecked</td>
<td>关闭状态时的文案(<code v-pre>type='line'</code>和<code v-pre>size='sm'</code>时不生效)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
